{ >> q := 1. { x := 2. Tuuina-atu tusi: x. } amata. } 
puʻe: { Tuuina-atu tusi: ['Error, cannot assign, key not found: x, forgot to use ☞ ?']. }, amata.
Tuuina-atu laina-fou.
